  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Entering a 6 digit 2FA code should automatically continue the login process.\n# Details\nAt the moment, after a user has entered a 6 digit 2FA code, they need to press the \"Verify\" button (in VRChat itself or in the Unity SDK).\nIt would make sense if entering the 6th digit automatically continued the login process. This would speed up the login process for VRChat users, and speed up the Unity SDK login process for creators.",
